# Live-derived ingest captures: these are EVIDENCE ARTEFACTS, not source code.
# Each must stay byte-identical to the page it was captured from, and Prettier
# rewrites markup -- it respells `<br/>` as `<br />`, the exact spelling the
# Vercel sandbox capture exists to pin. Formatting one destroys the property
# its tests depend on, which is the same reason the malformed fixture below is
# excluded. Deliberately adapter-agnostic so a future live-derived JSON or XML
# capture is covered without editing this file, and deliberately provider-
# agnostic so a new provider does not have to rediscover the collision.
# The `example` corpus is hand-written rather than captured -- it is faithful to
# nothing, so it stays formatted and is re-included here.
**/fixtures/ingest/*/*/*/source.*
!**/fixtures/ingest/example/**

# Intentionally-malformed JSON ingest fixtures: these MUST stay invalid so the
# adapter's rejected-candidate path is exercised, so Prettier cannot parse them.
# MUST remain below the re-inclusion above: the last matching pattern wins, so
# moving this line higher would let the `example` negation format it and make
# the rejected-candidate fixture valid.
**/fixtures/ingest/example/*/malformed/source.json
